# Slate runtime integrity depends on byte-identical files.
# Hosts verify generated `shell/` assets with SHA-256 hashes recorded in
# `.slate-runtime.json`, so line endings must be deterministic on every
# platform and every clone. Normalize to LF in the repository and on checkout.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be transformed.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.svgz binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.eot binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
